---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro'
import Header from '@/components/Header'
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro'
import { BUSINESS, telHref } from '@/lib/business'

const LAST_UPDATED = 'October 29, 2026'
const linkClass = 'text-text underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent-ink transition-colors duration-200'
---

<Base
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${BUSINESS.name}`}
  description={`How ${BUSINESS.name} handles the details you send through the quote form, by phone or by email.`}
>
  <Header client:load />
  <main class="bg-bg pt-36 pb-24 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-28">
    <article class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-8 lg:px-12 text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.8] text-text/70">
      <h1 class="font-heading font-bold text-text leading-tight mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem)">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[0.8rem] text-text/65 mb-12">Last updated {LAST_UPDATED}</p>

      <p class="mb-10">
        This page explains what {BUSINESS.legalName} collects through this website, why, and what happens to it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-text text-xl mb-3">What we collect</h2>
      <p class="mb-10">
        When you request a quote, the form asks for your first and last name, email address, phone number, the
        service you are interested in and an optional message. We collect nothing else through the site, and you do
        not need an account.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-text text-xl mb-3">How your request reaches us</h2>
      <p class="mb-10">
        The form is delivered by <a href="https://web3forms.com" class={linkClass} rel="noopener">Web3Forms</a>, a
        form service that emails your request to us. Web3Forms handles it under its own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-text text-xl mb-3">How we use it</h2>
      <p class="mb-10">
        We use your details only to reply to your request and to quote and carry out your project. We do not sell
        them or share them with anyone for marketing.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-text text-xl mb-3">What stays in your browser</h2>
      <p class="mb-10">
        After you send a request, your browser stores the time it was sent, so the form can prevent accidental
        repeat submissions. It holds no personal details, and clearing this site's data removes it. The site does
        not use analytics or advertising trackers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-text text-xl mb-3">The map</h2>
      <p class="mb-10">
        The contact section shows a Google map. When it loads, Google receives your IP address and may set cookies,
        as described in <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class={linkClass} rel="noopener">Google's
        privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-text text-xl mb-3">Your choices</h2>
      <p class="mb-10">
        You can ask us to show, correct or delete the details you sent us. This site is not meant for children
        under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-text text-xl mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.email}`} class={`${linkClass} break-all`}>{BUSINESS.email}</a> or call{' '}
        <a href={telHref} class={`${linkClass} whitespace-nowrap`}>{BUSINESS.phone.display}</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
